volleyball game indoors.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:03.801
That's crazy.
-Yeah.

00:07:03.801 --> 00:07:05.934
-And --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:05.934 --> 00:07:08.734
And I think it's --
And I think, as you know,

00:07:08.734 --> 00:07:11.167
in anybody in a position
of power should respect the fact

00:07:11.167 --> 00:07:13.334
that we are in a moment
where women

00:07:13.334 --> 00:07:15.834
are finally dominating the way
that they deserve to be,

00:07:15.834 --> 00:07:20.400
and whether it's me or not,
they should hire a woman.

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:22.667
-Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:22.667 --> 00:07:23.868
-So...
-I think --

00:07:23.868 --> 00:07:25.534
-Wouldn't you guys
all like to see a woman

00:07:25.534 --> 00:07:28.467
behind a desk?
-Yeah, absolutely.

00:07:28.467 --> 00:07:30.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:30.534 --> 00:07:32.200
-Yeah.

00:07:33.567 --> 00:07:36.434
-I think especially --
-Yeah.

00:07:36.434 --> 00:07:39.267
-...with this political --
with the election --

00:07:39.267 --> 00:07:40.734
with the election coming up,

00:07:40.734 --> 00:07:42.434
I think it would be great
to have a woman

00:07:42.434 --> 00:07:44.634
in late nights to talk --
-And women --

00:07:44.634 --> 00:07:47.434
